  "title": "Homeostatic self-regulation is not reward maximization",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "162682a7-1ec9-459e-a27a-9756e8ab479d",
      "text": "Homeostatic self-regulation resembles reinforcement learning but is not the same. Its target is not an arbitrary reward but homeostatic well-being, an internal parameter that controls the ongoing ability to decide well: the object of the game is to keep playing it.",
